Third-party notices

koffi (https://www.npmjs.com/package/koffi) is loaded at runtime from the host
DSH profile; it is not bundled with this package. koffi is distributed under
the MIT license by its own authors.

The Win32 and GDI function signatures and the per-monitor DPI awareness setup
follow the publicly documented Windows API. The approach of driving those APIs
through koffi was learned from Coopanion's Cortico desktop-pet extension
(https://github.com/Pal-AI-Lab/Coopanion), which is not copied here; this file
is an independent implementation of the same public API surface.
